Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.63,0:05:34.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.43,0:05:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,15点方向  你去放哨\N{\fnArial\fs30}15, you're on point.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.43,0:05:55.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们没地方可去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got no place left to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这两个僵尸群相遇  我们就完蛋了\N{\fnArial\fs30}When this herd meets up with this one, we'll be cut off.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.77,0:05:59.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,绝对去不了南边\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll never make it south.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:02.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么办  那群大概有150只吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}What would you say? That was about 150 head?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.22,0:06:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那还是上周  现在可能已经翻倍了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That was last week. It could be twice that by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.85,0:06:06.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这条河能拖延它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}This river could have delayed them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.80,0:06:07.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果动作快\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we move fast,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.65,0:06:10.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们也许能从这穿过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}we might have a shot to tear right through there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.02,0:06:11.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果那两群合并了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, but if this group joins with that one,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.51,0:06:13.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就可能从这条路蜂拥而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They could spill out this way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.34,0:06:14.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说我们被挡住去路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So we're blocked.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.41,0:06:16.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在只能再回27区\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only thing to do is double back at 27
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.44,0:06:18.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从那儿去格林维尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and swing towards Greenville.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.04,0:06:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去过那儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, we picked through that already.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.75,0:06:21.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好像整个冬天我们都在不停绕圈子\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like we spent the winter going in circles.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.50,0:06:23.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I know. I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.40,0:06:25.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从纽南向西走\N{\fnArial\fs30}At Newnan we'll push west.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.32,0:06:27.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那里还没去过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Haven't been through there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.65,0:06:30.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能一直四处奔波\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't keep going house to house.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.66,0:06:33.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,必须找到个能安全过几周的地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Need to find someplace to hole up for a few weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.44,0:06:35.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  出发前我们能\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. Is it cool if we get to the creek
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.99,0:06:37.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,先去趟河边吗  不会很久\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we head out? Won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.69,0:06:39.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,得去装水  一会煮沸\N{\fnArial\fs30}We got to fill up on water. We can boil it later.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.33,0:06:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,随便\N{\fnArial\fs30}Knock yourself out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.48,0:06:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她不能再这么奔波了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She can't take much more of this moving about.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.05,0:06:45.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能怎么办  让她在逃亡中生产吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What else can we do? Let her give birth on the run?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.53,0:06:48.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恐怕没别的选择了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you see a way around that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.60,0:06:54.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,趁他们洗裤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, while the others wash their panties,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.39,0:06:56.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,咱们打猎去\N{\fnArial\fs30}let's go hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.57,0:06:59.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一只猫头鹰可满足不了大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}That owl didn't exactly hit the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.61,0:07:46.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-当心背后  -知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Watch the backside. - Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.46,0:07:55.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry. Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.54,0:08:43.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.80,0:08:46.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是能关上那门\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we can shut that gate,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.95,0:08:48.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以防更多的进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}prevent more from filling the yard,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.08,0:08:50.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们就能解决这些行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can pick off these walkers.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.79,0:08:52.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晚上就能拿下这块空地了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll take the field by tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.29,0:08:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,该怎么关门呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how do we shut the gate?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.54,0:08:56.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去  你们掩护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll do it. You guys cover me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.56,0:08:59.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不行  这简直是自杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. It's a suicide run.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.63,0:09:01.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我速度最快\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm the fastest.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.92,0:09:05.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你  玛姬和贝丝去那边尽量引它们注意\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you, Maggie, and Beth draw as many as you can over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.33,0:09:06.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从栅栏后捅它们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pop 'em through the fence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.91,0:09:09.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔  去那边的塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl, go back to the other tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.45,0:09:11.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡萝尔  你枪法越来越好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carol, you've become a pretty good shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.57,0:09:14.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仔细瞄准  别浪费子弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take your time. We don't have a lot of ammo to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.11,0:09:17.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔  你和卡尔上这座塔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel, you and Carl take this tower.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.29,0:09:20.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去关门\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll run for the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.45,0:09:33.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-过来  -有种过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Hey, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.36,0:09:44.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-来啊  -来这啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on! - Hey, come here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:48.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  来啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.20,0:10:06.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.36,0:10:24.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.11,0:10:29.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.52,0:10:31.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey! Come on, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.14,0:10:56.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He did it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.09,0:10:58.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Light it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.23,0:11:46.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fansticing
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.08,0:11:48.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,射得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice shooting.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.89,0:11:50.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:53.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,几周来最舒坦的一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't felt this good in weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.00,0:11:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.09,0:12:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离开农场后  好久没见这么广阔的地方了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We haven't had this much space since we left the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.98,0:12:40.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像妈妈亲手做的味道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mmm. Just like mom used to make.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.58,0:12:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天我们把所有尸体聚到一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tomorrow we'll put all the bodies together.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.29,0:12:55.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让它们远离水源\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to keep them away from that water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.74,0:12:57.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们在铁栏下挖一条渠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if we can dig a canal under the fence,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.63,0:12:59.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就能引来新鲜水源\N{\fnArial\fs30}we'll have plenty of fresh water.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.84,0:13:01.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,土壤不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}And the soil is good,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.44,0:13:03.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以撒下种子\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can plant some seeds.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:06.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,种一些番茄  黄瓜  黄豆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grow some tomatoes, cucumbers, soybeans.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.22,0:13:12.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他已经检查三圈了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's his third time around.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.63,0:13:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果铁栏有漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}If there was any part of it compromised,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.23,0:13:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他一定会发现的\N{\fnArial\fs30}he'd have found it by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.21,0:13:24.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是个待产的好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}This'll be a good place to have the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.46,0:13:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.73,0:13:39.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然不多  但如果我不给你带点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not much, but if I don't bring you something,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.87,0:13:41.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你压根就不会吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}you won't eat at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.65,0:13:45.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我猜她肚里的小肖恩食欲也不错吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess little Shane over there has got quite the appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.95,0:13:48.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别这么毒舌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't be mean.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.18,0:13:51.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瑞克比我预期的带我们走了更远\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rick's gotten us a lot farther than I ever thought he would,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.69,0:13:52.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这点不可否认\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll give him that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.68,0:13:56.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肖恩就做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shane could never have done that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.51,0:13:59.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.49,0:14:02.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是步枪  后座力太大\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's that rifle. The kickback.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.27,0:14:04.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不太习惯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just not used to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.07,0:14:07.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.97,0:14:27.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还是回去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.74,0:14:31.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今夜浪漫满屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty romantic.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:33.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,顺便来一发吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Want to screw around?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.94,0:14:39.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去下面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll go down first.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.52,0:14:40.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那更好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Even better.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.43,0:14:42.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别扯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.88,0:14:49.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,贝丝  给我唱那首帕迪·雷利的歌吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bethy, sing Paddy Reilly for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.07,0:14:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,自从你妈妈离世后\N{\fnArial\fs30}I haven't heard that, I think,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.26,0:14:53.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就再没有听过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}since your mother was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.57,0:14:55.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  求你别让她唱那首\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, not that one, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an8}{\fn方正黑体简体\fs18\b1\bord1\shad1\3c&H2F2F2F&}一首凯尔特民谣
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.13,0:15:01.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就唱《离别的酒杯》吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How about "Parting Glass"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.02,0:15:04.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人想听\N{\fnArial\fs30}No one wants to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:08.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,唱吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.25,0:15:13.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.56,0:16:59.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真动听\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beautiful.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.68,0:17:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们最好都睡一觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Better all turn in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.01,0:17:07.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来守夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take watch over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.69,0:17:09.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明天还有大事要做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got a big day tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.58,0:17:11.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.13,0:17:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道大家都筋疲力尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know we're all exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.00,0:17:20.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天我们赢得漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}This was a great win.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.93,0:17:24.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们还得再努力一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we've got to push just a little bit more.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.12,0:17:32.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大部分行尸都穿着守卫和囚犯的衣服\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most of the walkers are dressed as guards and prisoners.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.17,0:17:34.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来这个地方很早就沦陷了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looks like this place fell pretty early.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.60,0:17:37.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就意味着供应品可能会很充足\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could mean the supplies may be intact.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.30,0:17:39.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱一般会有医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}They'd have an infirmary,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.44,0:17:41.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有食堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}a commissary.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.48,0:17:42.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有军械库吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}An armory?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.34,0:17:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,军械库单独建在监狱外\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would be outside the prison itself,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.82,0:17:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但也不会太远\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not too far away.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.12,0:17:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狱长办公室里应该会有军械库的位置信息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Warden's offices would have info on the location.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.87,0:17:51.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,武器  食物  药品\N{\fnArial\fs30}Weapons, food, medicine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.13,0:17:54.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个地方可能是个大金矿\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place could be a gold mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.29,0:17:56.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们的弹药太少了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're dangerously low on ammo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:58.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀不了几个就会用完\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'd run out before we make a dent.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.73,0:18:00.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's why we have to go in there...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.61,0:18:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,近身肉搏\N{\fnArial\fs30}hand to hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.86,0:18:08.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一起经历了那么多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all we've been through,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.59,0:18:12.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们能赢的  我有信心\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can handle it. I know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.92,0:18:19.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这帮混球死定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}These assholes don't stand a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.72,0:18:49.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我感谢你所做的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I appreciate everything you're doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.30,0:18:50.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都非常感谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}we all do,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.46,0:18:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是行尸那么多  大家都精疲力尽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's been a death March and they're exhausted.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.75,0:18:56.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不能先休息几天吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can we just enjoy this for a few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.54,0:19:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝过些日子就要出世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby will be here in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.67,0:19:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没有时间来玩野餐\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no time for a picnic.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.06,0:19:04.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对  但是我们应该先找好住处\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, but it's time to get the house in order.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.65,0:19:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你以为我在做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think I'm doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.31,0:19:10.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是最有能力的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're absolute best.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.67,0:19:12.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别对我居高临下说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't patronize me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.28,0:19:14.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:16.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是想说\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.16,0:19:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,宝宝就快出世了\N{\fnArial\fs30}the baby is about to be here
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.81,0:19:21.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我们需要谈谈  -谈什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and we need to talk about-- - About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.10,0:19:29.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们一直逃避的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}Things we've been avoiding--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.02,0:19:31.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想要谈谈  那就去和赫谢尔谈吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to talk? Talk to Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.08,0:19:33.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在做事  洛莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm doing stuff, Lori.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.22,0:19:37.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还"谈事情"  事还不够多吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Things." Isn't that enough?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.84,0:19:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm still here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.09,0:19:45.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.79,0:19:47.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.85,0:21:13.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,准备好了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.23,0:21:21.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.99,0:21:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.15,0:21:34.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠拢  靠拢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get tight! Get tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.87,0:21:38.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-过来  来这  -这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on, over here! - Hey! Over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.93,0:21:59.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过来  来这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.38,0:22:01.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不要打乱队形  -我们需要那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't break rank! - We need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.96,0:22:04.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,T仔  T仔\N{\fnArial\fs30}T! T!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.50,0:22:07.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie! Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.05,0:22:10.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.81,0:22:18.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.30,0:22:44.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看不到他们 你能看见吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't see them. Can you see them?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.37,0:22:46.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在后面吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back there?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.69,0:22:56.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,达里尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daryl!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.41,0:23:08.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-快点  -好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on. - We're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.79,0:23:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}See that?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.44,0:23:55.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,停一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.57,0:24:00.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看起来很安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it looks secure.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.19,0:24:03.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那边的院子看起来可不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not from the look of that courtyard over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.56,0:24:06.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是个平民\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's a civilian.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.50,0:24:08.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以监狱里可能到处都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}So the interior could be overrun with walkers
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.91,0:24:10.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,从外面涌进来的行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}from outside the prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.69,0:24:13.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果哪里破开了  我们怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if there's walls down, what are we gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.13,0:24:14.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,总不能重新开拓建这个地方吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't rebuild this whole place.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.76,0:24:16.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不能有盲点\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't risk a blind spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.16,0:24:19.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须继续往里去\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have to push in.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.17,0:27:27.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.38,0:27:28.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回家真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Home sweet home.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.98,0:27:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,眼下已经很不错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}For the time being.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.24,0:27:32.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里安全吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's secure?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.96,0:27:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个单元区安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}This cellblock is.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.30,0:27:39.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,监狱其他部分呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the rest of the prison?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.44,0:27:42.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明早我们就去找餐厅和医务室\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the morning, we'll find the cafeteria and infirmary.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.90,0:27:44.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在监狱里睡吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We sleep in the cells?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.81,0:27:47.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我在狱吏那找到钥匙  达里尔也有一套\N{\fnArial\fs30}I found keys on some guards. Daryl has a set, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.70,0:27:49.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不睡在笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't sleeping in no cage.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.41,0:27:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我去上面睡\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll take the perch.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.57,0:27:54.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.47,0:27:59.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.29,0:28:06.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真恶心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.68,0:28:08.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还记得那个储藏室吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, remember the storage units?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.30,0:28:12.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其实  其实挺舒服的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's actually-- it's actually comfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.05,0:28:14.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,试试看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.85,0:28:22.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找到你的房间了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You find your cell yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.87,0:28:26.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只想  只想把贝丝安顿好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Just ah… just want Beth to sleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.54,0:28:29.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-明天见  -明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you tomorrow. - See you.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.89,0:28:36.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我实在精疲力尽了  我不管了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so exhausted, I don't even care.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.94,0:28:43.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来  我看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me see.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.94,0:28:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What're you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.40,0:28:49.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看有没有擦伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Checking for scratches.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.61,0:30:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你在这里干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.16,0:30:53.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要点光\N{\fnArial\fs30}I needed some light.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.37,0:31:09.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喝水\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.57,0:31:33.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,外面情况怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How is it out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.31,0:31:35.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Same.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.52,0:31:37.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,太静了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.14,0:31:41.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你撒谎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.46,0:31:46.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们几天后就得出发\N{\fnArial\fs30}We should go in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.78,0:31:52.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们要来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.22,0:31:57.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你得赶快走  -不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You should go. - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.03,0:31:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会拖你后腿的  走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll hold you back. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.32,0:32:02.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我能照顾好自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.26,0:32:04.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我整个冬天都在救你的小命  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved your ass all winter, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.43,0:32:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不要你为我丧命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't have you dying for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.98,0:32:24.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好兵不弃岗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good soldier won't leave your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.14,0:32:26.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去你的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Screw you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.71,0:32:35.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们过几天就离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll go in a few days.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.29,0:32:47.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们待在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we stay...
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.85,0:32:51.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我会死在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll die here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.64,0:33:32.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还不错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.98,0:33:37.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闪光弹  强力手雷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flashbangs, CS triple-chasers.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.73,0:33:39.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道对行尸管不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not sure how they'd work on walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.46,0:33:40.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是还是带上吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we'll take 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.19,0:33:44.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我才不穿这鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I ain't wearing this shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.13,0:33:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可以开水消毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}We could boil 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.30,0:33:48.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,林子里可没那么多树可以烧  得了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ain't enough firewood in the whole forest. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.34,0:33:51.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有  我们没穿这些也一路走过来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Besides, we made it this far without 'em, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.93,0:33:54.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,赫谢尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hershel.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.49,0:33:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.02,0:33:58.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  没什么好担心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Nothing to worry about.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.26,0:34:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是肚子里的孩子  我觉得保不住\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the baby. I think I lost it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.65,0:34:11.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你感觉不到胎动吗  -丝毫没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You haven't felt it move? - Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.31,0:34:13.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也没有宫缩\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no Braxton-Hicks.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.67,0:34:16.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,开始我以为是疲劳或营养不良的原因\N{\fnArial\fs30}At first I thought it was exhaustion or malnutrition.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.33,0:34:17.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你贫血吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're anemic?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.56,0:34:22.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们都感染了  那这孩子也一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we're all infected, then so's the baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.58,0:34:25.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是孩子是死胎呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what if it's stillborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.86,0:34:28.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要是已经胎死腹中怎么办\N{\fnArial\fs30}What if it's dead inside me right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.63,0:34:30.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要是子宫撕裂怎么办  -停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What if it rips me apart… - Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.30,0:34:33.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别让恐惧占据你的内心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't let your fear take control of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:33.44,0:34:34.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.70,0:34:38.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假设孩子活下来  而我死于分娩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then let's say it lives and I die during childbirth.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.28,0:34:41.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那不会发生的  -怎么不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not going to happen. - Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.80,0:34:44.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现代医疗时代以前  很多女人都死于分娩\N{\fnArial\fs30}How many women died in childbirth before modern medicine?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.15,0:34:48.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我再活过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I come back,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.23,0:34:51.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攻击孩子呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}what if I attack it?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.53,0:34:54.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,攻击你  或者瑞克呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or you? Or Rick?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.64,0:34:55.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者卡尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Or Carl?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.32,0:34:58.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果万一那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}If I do, if there is any chance,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.54,0:35:00.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就立刻杀了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}you put me down immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.25,0:35:03.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我和孩子都是行尸  不要犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't hesitate. Me, the baby,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.77,0:35:06.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we're walkers,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.03,0:35:10.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别犹豫  别试着救我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't hesitate and you don't try to save us.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.12,0:35:11.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.85,0:35:21.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本能更好的  如果...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It might have been better if--
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.38,0:35:22.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}If what?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.66,0:35:25.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我没逃出农场的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd never made it off the farm.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.69,0:35:29.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你累了  被吓到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're exhausted, frightened.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.41,0:35:30.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, that's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:34.39,0:35:35.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我儿子嫌我烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}My son can't stand me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.50,0:35:39.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我丈夫经过那件事后\N{\fnArial\fs30}And my husband, after what I put him through...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.90,0:35:43.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都在为那件事难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all been carrying that weight
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.63,0:35:45.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,整个冬天都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}all winter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.56,0:35:47.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我试着跟他好好说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I tried to talk to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.25,0:35:48.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他...\N{\fnArial\fs30}He...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.19,0:35:51.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会想通的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll come around.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:54.96,0:35:56.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他恨我\N{\fnArial\fs30}He hates me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.51,0:36:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他虽然不忍心说  但我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's too good a man to say it, but I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.64,0:36:05.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我离间了他和肖恩  我令他成为了杀手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I put him and Shane at odds. I put that knife in his hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.52,0:36:13.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道谁不在乎这些屁事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know who doesn't give a shit about that?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.46,0:36:15.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这个孩子不在乎\N{\fnArial\fs30}This baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.88,0:36:20.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我们确保一切都好起来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's make sure everything's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.07,0:36:38.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你用不上那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}You won't need that.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.54,0:36:41.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你留在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay put.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.39,0:36:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're kidding?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:42.20,0:36:43.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不知道里面什么情况\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what's in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:44.13,0:36:46.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们遭遇不测  你就是最后一个男子汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something goes wrong, you could be the last man standing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.86,0:36:48.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我需要你在这里管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to handle things here.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.34,0:36:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:51.82,0:36:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很好  我们走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.83,0:38:04.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.71,0:39:07.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-往回走  快  -有行尸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go back. Go back! Move! - Walkers!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.66,0:39:15.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:32.43,0:39:33.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}In here!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.56,0:39:43.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-格伦和玛姬呢  -我们必须回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Glenn and Maggie? - We have to go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.42,0:39:45.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可走哪条路呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But which way?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.49,0:40:04.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬  格伦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maggie? Glenn?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.65,0:40:13.28,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-瑞克  -爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Rick? - Dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.63,0:40:15.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.39,0:40:19.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mag?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.10,0:40:22.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mag?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.34,0:40:27.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.52,0:40:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不  -玛姬\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No! - Maggie!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.37,0:40:40.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸  不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Daddy, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.25,0:40:42.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-达里尔  -天啊  帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Daryl! - Oh, god, help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.89,0:40:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-格伦  -我们被堵住了  快回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Glenn! - We're blocked! Get back! Get back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.90,0:40:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快  快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.94,0:40:57.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把门打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.06,0:41:01.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.46,0:41:05.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,关上门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut the door!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.60,0:41:11.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,门堵住了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got it? Have you got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:17.30,0:41:18.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.41,0:41:23.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,按住他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.89,0:41:41.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有一个办法能救你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Only one way to keep you alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:06.09,0:42:07.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他失血很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's bleeding out.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.91,0:42:11.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,蹲下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.44,0:42:20.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卧槽\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holyshit!